  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The distance test is measured on the trace and only the trace: gps_trace.trace_distance_km is 4.05 km against the booked optimal of 3.2 km, an excess of 0.85 km or 26.56%, and POL-RD-01 expressly forbids citing trip_record.actual_distance_km (4.0 km, a rounded convenience copy of the same measurement) for the threshold test. That 0.85 km is the whole of what the rider's evidence proves on distance; nothing in the bundle shows a larger excess, whatever the claim text implies.",
