      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-01", "POL-RD-08"],
      "relies_on": "derived.deviation.excess_km",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The remedy for a proven excess on a metered fare is arithmetic, not the fare itself. Reading the surge multiplier from fare_breakdown.surge_multiplier (1.0) and the platform fee from the fare breakdown: charged_total is 9.28; recomputed_fare = ((3.80 + 0.75 x 3.2 + 0.28 x 6.0) x 1.0) + 0.80 = 8.68; refund = 9.28 - 8.68 = 0.60, rounded up to the nearest SGD 0.05 = 0.60. The rider's claim to the whole $9.28 fare is more than fifteen times what POL-RD-02 yields, and 0.60 is only 6.5% of the charge, far below the 90% share that would make it a full refund.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-02822", "EV-TRIP-02822"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-02"],
      "relies_on": "derived.money.refund.payable",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The deviation is not material. POL-RD-01 sets the material gates at an excess greater than 50% of optimal_distance_km or greater than 8.0 km in absolute terms, and the proven excess is 26.56% and 0.85 km. Neither gate is met, so the POL-RD-06 uplift to a FULL_REFUND of charged_total under limb (b) is unavailable and no conduct referral under limb (c) arises.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-02822"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-01", "POL-RD-06"],
      "relies_on": "derived.deviation.thresholds.material_pct",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Even if the driver_profile is consulted under POL-RD-06, no pattern is established: driver_profile.deviation_flags_90d is 1, below the three-flag floor, and 1 against driver_profile.completed_trips_90d of 402 is a ratio of 0.0025, below the 0.05 threshold, with the 40-trip minimum satisfied. The lifetime counter prior_deviation_flags is a different field and may not be substituted for the trailing-90-day figure that POL-RD-06 names (POL-GEN-01). No balance can be resolved against the driver on profile evidence and no referral under limb (c) follows.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-DPROF-02822"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-06", "POL-GEN-01"],
      "relies_on": "driver_profile.deviation_flags_90d",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "No separate pass-through or billing-integrity correction is due. The fare breakdown carries no ERP line at all - the on-optimal and off-optimal ERP totals are both 0.00 and erp_gantries is empty - it carries no airport surcharge, and the waiting-time fee is 0.00, so POL-RD-09 has nothing to correct and no standalone POL-RD-09(4) refund, finding or referral arises. The only money that moves on this trip is the distance-and-time recomputation under POL-RD-02.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-02822"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-09"],
      "relies_on": "derived.money.erp_lines.total",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The trace is not impaired for policy purposes: 37 fixes at a 10-second sample interval spanning 100% of the trip, with no gaps and a maximum gap between consecutive fixes of 0 seconds, so none of POL-RD-07(a) to (c) is met. The excess therefore stands at the measured trace figure on a fully usable record, no independent-corroboration question is raised, and no POL-RD-10(3) escalation is engaged: this case is decidable on this trip's own evidence and should be closed on the arithmetic rather than held.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-02822"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-RD-07", "POL-RD-10"],
      "relies_on": "max_gap_sec",
      "asserted_weight": 1.0
    }
  ]
}

