ptimal stands. POL-RD-11 does not close the refund route — fare_model is METERED and quoted_fare_sgd is null. POL-RD-12 does not apply — vehicle_type is RYDE_X and no solo optimal exists. Driver, your statement 'Followed the app' names no specific artifact and no specific clause; under POL-RD-08 it does not discharge the burden that shifted to you, and it carries no weight. No traffic advisory covers this trip (EV-ADVIS-02822-01 is MISSING at weight 0.0), so no external-cause exoneration was available to you. TRACE INTEGRITY. POL-RD-07 does not impair the trace: 37 fixes, 10-second sample interval, 100% coverage and max_gap_sec 0.0, so none of limbs (a) to (c) is met, the deviation stands on the trace alone, and POL-RD-10(3) is not engaged. PROCESS AND CONFIDENCE. The one discarded claim is the Rider advocate's POL-RD-03 point, discarded by the referee for citing a weight-0.0 artifact without disclosing its MISSING_ARTIFACT code; the point did not affect the outcome because the Driver asserted no traffic cause at all. Every artifact carrying a deciding fact here — EV-GPS-02822, EV-TRIP-02822 and EV-FARE-02822 — is at weight_multiplier 1.0, so confidence 0.95 sits under the cap and well above the 0.70 floor. The monetary effect of 0.60 does not exceed the POL-GEN-05 execution threshold of 8.00, so this provisional ruling executes automatically, subject to your appeal route under POL-GEN-04."
